<p>From the ground around you, you form living stone vines extending from your feet.</p><p>Each turn, the vines will attempt to seize a random target within radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 5, 6, 6.</acronym></p><p>Affected creatures are pinned to the ground and take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Willpower 100">29, 38, 45, 50, 55</acronym> nature damage each turn for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9</acronym> turns.</p><p>A creature entangled by the vines will have a chance to break free each turn, and will automatically succeed if it is more than <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8, 9, 9, 10, 10</acronym> grids away from you.</p><p>The chance to affect targets and damage increase with talent level and Willpower.</p>